    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh okay thanks for the heads up. honestly though im finding it kinda hard to stay motivated with everything right now and i dont really want to deal with a bunch of restrictions if i can help it. is there like... a middle ground? like maybe just small amounts of the cheese or salami wont hurt? i dont want to feel like im on a super strict diet and make my mood worse.",
